null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 115, "text": "For singer and guitarist Bob Boyd , 57 , the Ranch has been home since he left Chattanooga , Tenn. , 35 years ago ."}, {"id": 12, "document_id": "conll04:train:11", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 50, "text": "Rome is in Lazio province and Naples in Campania ."}, {"id": 13, "document_id": "conll04:train:12", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 191, "text": "He has been the State Department 's refugee coordinator and is a former Harvard politics professor. _Ronald for the rank of ambassador during his tenure as U.S. negotiator on textile matters."}, {"id": 14, "document_id": "conll04:train:13", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 47, "text": "( By ITAR-TASS correspondent Mikhail Shevtsov )"}, {"id": 15, "document_id": "conll04:train:14", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 137, "text": "It is not and never has been designed or advertised as a threatening or abusive type of thing , ' ' said XBT spokesman Allan Fitzmaurice."}, {"id": 16, "document_id": "conll04:train:15", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 57, "text": "In 1752 , flagmaker Betsy Ross was born in Philadelphia ."}, {"id": 17, "document_id": "conll04:train:16", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 50, "text": "Fire Island National Seashore , Patchogue , N.Y. ;"}, {"id": 18, "document_id": "conll04:train:17", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 74, "text": "OW3004022094 Beijing XINHUA Domestic Service in Chinese 1149 GMT 29 Apr 94"}, {"id": 19, "document_id": "conll04:train:18", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 142, "text": "In Idaho , where 76 , 000 acres have been blackened , smoke from fires miles away hung over Boise but no warnings were issued to stay indoors."}, {"id": 20, "document_id": "conll04:train:19", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 237, "text": "The strong Santa Ana winds that earlier produced wind gusts as high as 100 mph in Southern California , destroying a blimp , shutting down an airport , and cutting power to thousands of utility customers were subsiding , officials said ."}, {"id": 21, "document_id": "conll04:train:20", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 227, "text": "But Sen. Strom Thurmond , R-S.C. , sponsor of a proposed constitutional amendment , said , ` ` An overwhelming majority of Americans are looking to the Congress to ... restore the proper civil respect for our American flag. ' '"}, {"id": 22, "document_id": "conll04:train:21", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 229, "text": "With considerable rough sailing and difficulty anticipated in the process of ratification by the U.S. Congress , the Congress is hardly expected to complete the ratification process within the time limit set by the UR agreement ."}, {"id": 23, "document_id": "conll04:train:22", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 239, "text": "In another scene , President James Garfield 's assassin Charles Guiteau ( Jonathan Hadary ) prances up and down the stairs of the gallows where he will be hanged , all the while singing a spirited Gospel tune about \" going to the Lordy . \""}, {"id": 24, "document_id": "conll04:train:23", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 29, "text": "SPACE CENTER , Houston ( AP )"}, {"id": 25, "document_id": "conll04:train:24", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 98, "text": "Grant B. Cooper , an attorney who defended Kennedy assassin Sirhan B. Sirhan , has died at age 87."}, {"id": 26, "document_id": "conll04:train:25", "parent_id": null, "level": 0, "span_start": 0, "span_end": 154, "text": "Woodrow Wilson ( 28th President ) : Born at about midnight , leaving the date in doubt , Dec. 28 or 29 , 1856 , in a Presbyterian manse in Staunton , Va ."}, {"id